    "head_commit_message": "perf(formation): perception and the shuffle look only where they could find something (#200)\n\n* perf(formation): perception and the shuffle look only where they could find something\n\nPerception skips far pairs on a box of unit centres found in one pass, not\nframe rects. A unit stepping up to a free front place weighs only the front\ncolumns found free once a planning (ShuffleFront.open), not every column -\nunits x columns a tick per re-forming squad before. Both choose exactly as\nbefore. scaling_check gains a stacks stage: 1, 2, 4 lanes of 128 a side.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcTW8o7t6QUEXUN9XNU6yv\n\n* chore(ci): sim checks summary shows the scaling check's stacks lines\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcTW8o7t6QUEXUN9XNU6yv\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Test <test@example.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
